From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Poul Sander <poul@poulsander.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 18:11:32 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] OpenArena: ^8 orange and nine colour codes

OpenArena has nine text colours: ^0 to ^8, with ^8 orange
(1.0, 0.43, 0.0). Any other character after ^ is printed literally.
Quake3e's 64-entry CPMA/CNQ3 colour table is kept but only entries 0-8
are reachable, so the engine console renders colour codes the same way
OpenArena's cgame and ui QVMs do. ^8 maps to ANSI yellow on the tty.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
